    {
      "type": "listeningComp",
      "audioUrl": "/audio/unit-22/declaracion-guardia.mp3",
      "transcript": "Buenas noches. Hice mi ronda a la una, como siempre. Todo estuvo normal. Después fui al almacén a buscar una linterna. Estuve allí veinte minutos. No vi a nadie y nadie vino a buscarme. Cuando volví a la sala catorce, a las tres, el cuadro ya no estuvo en la pared. Yo no tuve la llave de esa sala. Se lo juro.",
      "translation": "Good evening. I did my rounds at one, as always. Everything was normal. Then I went to the storeroom to get a flashlight. I was there twenty minutes. I did not see anyone and nobody came looking for me. When I returned to room fourteen, at three, the painting was no longer on the wall. I did not have the key to that room. I swear.",
